            "review_title": "Review at DWok Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Adventure729303\n1 contribution\n0\nGood Quality and great taste !!\nAug 2017 • Solo\nI am Singaporean stationed in Hanoi, Vietnam for my work. I long craved for some Singapore zhi cha there. I google some restaurant and manage to find Dwok (read the review and was mostly good). \n\nAfter trying, I was very satisfied with the food there. The quality was good, the seafood are awesomely fresh and Damn!! the chili crab is marvelous!! \n\nThis is a Family Theme Restaurant\nStaff are Friendly & Helpful\nBoss is Kind enough to help with Language barrier\n\nPete\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 29, 2017",
