            "review_title": "Review at DWok Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tung T\n3 contributions\n0\nTerrible service\nJan 2017 • Friends\nThis restaurant is very near to my office. We decided to go there for lunch in group of 6 persons.\nWe asked for some frog food, they're out of order. So we ordered 3 Chili crab, and 3 fried rice.\nAfter 5 minutes, the waiter come back and said that they're out of order for chili crab since they just serve the last crab for the next table.\nSo we have to change the order again, from 3 chili crap orders to 2 fried rice and 1 clay pot rice.\nAfter 10 mins, 1 clay pot rice with beef served.\nNearly 30 mins later waiter come back again and tell us that they don't have any rice left to make our food (or in another word, they're out of order for all food with rice).\nGuess I don't have to say how disappointed did we feel. Very very very poor and unprofessional service. Never come back here for sure.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 24, 2017",
