            "review_text": "Hieu P\nHanoi, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nGreat food, great service\nSep 2015\nI've been to this restaurant many time before, and I love it. The curry crab and chilli crab here are excellent, and so is the level of service and cleanliness. In addition the owner is very nice and will spend his time chit chat with you if you feel like it. Price is very reasonable compare with other restaurant with the same quality. You should definitely try this one.\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2015",
